Girl: What are you doing? Prince: Oh, thank god I thought you were dead.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:07.380
Girl: Then why would you try to kiss me? Prince: Uh, hold on. Don't try to change the subject. Who are these seven guys texting you?

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:08.750
Girl: Uh, they're just my roommates.

