*Swish*

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.030
*girl grunts*

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:20.130
Beast: So now that we live together we need to establish a few ground rules.  Girl: Actually I'm a little hungry.

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:26.960
Beast: You are not allowed to step foot into that side of the house. Especially my room. Ever. It is forbidden. 

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:33.330
Girl: Okay, does that include the bathroom... Beast: Also, I'm going to need to know where you are and what you're doing at all times...

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:37.430
Beast: Because sometimes I get lonely. Do this and I'll release your father from my basement. 

