Eric: Uh, excuse me, miss? Have you seen my girlfriend?

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:02.010
Girl: Eric, it's me. Eric: You look familiar. Wait, I follow you on Twitter right?

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:05.650
Girl: You don't remember the crazy lady you stabbed with a boat for me? 

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:09.300
Eric: I think I know what the love of my life looks like. Girl: Even your dog knows it's me.

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.940
Eric: Let me get my dog back. Reina? Where'd you go?

