Naveen: My parents just cut me off. Girl: No you need to get a job. Naveen: Hahaha! I got a job

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:35.250
Naveen: My music. You woke up like that. You woke up like that. Flawless. 

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.890
Girl: You know what? Have fun making love to your mini guitar.  Naveen: It's a Ukelele.  

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:42.530
Naveen: Can I at least borrow your car to get home.  Girl: Take the bus!

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:47.990
Naveen: *sings* You're so fancy. You already know.

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:50.270
