00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:28.060
Girl: Who are you people? Aladin: The car that we road in was one that I'd stolen but who needs a ride when you live on the street?

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:35.800
Girl: You're homeless? Aladin: That monkey you swear follows us everywhere is my one and only friend

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.070
*Monkey howls*

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:38.530
*Chimes*

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.260
*Chinese music*

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:49.450
Girl: So yeah, I've had the absolute worst luck with dating lately. How about you? Shang: This is a little awkward. I kind of thought you were a dude. 

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:55.370
Girl: Excuse me? Shang: It's just from certain angles, and your hair is pulled back in these photos. Girl: I have boobs.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:04:01.750
Shang: Yeah, sorry. I guess I made a man out of you.  Prince: I have been looking everywhere for you. 

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:07.210
Girl: You know what? I'm done with Disney princes. Being single never bothered me anyway.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:12.220
Narrator: And she lived happily ever after. 

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:19.960
Prince: Why does this always keep happening to me? Shang: Hey, how you doin'?

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.780
Beast: Ladies love it when you kidnap their fathers.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:26.790
Beast: I'm gonna build her a library if you know what I mean. And by that I mean I'm actually going to build a library.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.520
Girl: Seriously, who are you talking to? Beast: I'm talking to Lumiere!

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:33.160
*Mock Disney music*

